    "appId": "us9ki7awa",
    "appSlug": "spin-winner",
    "appName": "SPIN WINNER",
    "userName": "Vikram_Kolkata_88",
    "rating": 5,
    "reviewText": "Wheel spin physics bohot balanced hai, har baar realistic momentum ke sath random segment pe rukta hai. Boosters unlock hone ke baad points multiplier activate hota hai jo score badhane me help karta hai. App ka size bohot chota hai, quickly download ho gaya aur mobile battery bhi consume nahi hoti. It is highly addictive and a great way to pass time without any complex rules.",
    "timestamp": "2026-09-10T03:16:58.091Z",
    "status": "published",
